/span></li>\n<li>ARIMA 模型：适合有趋势和季节性的序列</li>\n<li>Prophet：Facebook 开源，自动处理节假日和趋势变化</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>机器学习方法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>梯度提升树（XGBoost/LightGBM）：表格数据预测基线</li>\n<li>深度学习（LSTM/Transformer）：长序列时序预测</li>\n<li>特征工程要点：滞后特征、滚动统计量、节假日编码、天气特征</li>\n</ul>\n<p>预测准确率评估指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MAPE</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MAPE} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\left|\\frac{d_i - \\hat{d}_i}{d_i}\\right| \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAPE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0276em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><s